This section contains the contents of the repository's files.// Database types for the DoloGram Supabase project (D-56).
//
// PROVENANCE: transcription of the binding contract in v14 6.2 and M1-01 (column names, uuid ids,
// timestamptz timestamps, bigint counters, smallint attachment_count, text[] premium_flags). It is
// written in the shape `supabase gen types typescript` emits so that `npm run gen:types` can replace
// this file unchanged once M1-01 to M1-06 are applied to the hosted project.
//
// Calling rows/functions are included from the Phase 1 migration contract. Target-generated output
// remains pending until that migration is applied to a disposable target; the shared DoloGram target
// is not an isolated verification environment. Columns written by triggers or inside the database
// (chat_id/storage_path/sync_seq on message_media
// and reactions) are optional on Insert, matching the client-writable column set of 10.5.

export type Json = string | number | boolean | null | { [key: string]: Json | undefined } | Json[];

